{%- comment -%}
  ZeroStick footer.

  Four columns — SHOP / RESOURCES / SUPPORT / COMPANY. RESOURCES is the content
  hub: it is the only sitewide link into the guide pages, so every one of them
  gets a crawlable route from every page on the store.

  Three things to know before editing:

  1. Every guide link is wrapped in `{% if pages['handle'] != blank %}`. The
     pages are created in admin separately from this theme, so an unguarded link
     would 404 sitewide until the page existed. Same idiom as the EXO tab.
  2. Social URLs come from section settings, not hardcoded hrefs. The previous
     version shipped `href="#"` on all three, which is a dead link on every page
     of the site. An unset setting now renders nothing at all.
  3. Colours are white alphas, NOT Dawn's scheme tokens. zs-main.css:430 sets
     `footer { background: var(--black) }` unconditionally, so the footer is
     always a dark band — `rgb(var(--color-foreground))` would render near-black
     text on it in a light scheme.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- style -%}
  /* zs-main.css sets .footer-grid to 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr. The RESOURCES column
     makes a fifth child, which would wrap misaligned on that track list. */
  .zs-footer .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
  .zs-footer .footer-grid.has-resources { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
  @media (max-width: 989px) {
    .zs-footer .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 599px) {
    .zs-footer .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .zs-footer .footer-col ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .zs-footer .footer-col li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .zs-footer .zs-legal a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .zs-footer .zs-legal a:hover { color: #fff; }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Count first: with no guides published the column would otherwise render
  as a bare "Resources" heading over an empty list.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign guide_count = 0 -%}
{%- assign guide_handles_probe = 'dualsense-edge-stick-drift-guide,tmr-vs-hall-effect,how-tmr-modules-work,testing-and-calibration,installation-guide,compatibility,faq,8k-controllers,ps5-builder' | split: ',' -%}
{%- for h in guide_handles_probe -%}
  {%- assign probe = pages[h] -%}
  {%- if probe.url -%}{%- assign guide_count = guide_count | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

<footer class="zs-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid{% if guide_count > 0 %} has-resources{% endif %}">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">
          <img
            src="{{ 'zerostick-logo.png' | asset_url }}"
            alt="ZeroStick"
            width="150" height="38" loading="lazy"
            style="height:38px;width:auto;margin-bottom:16px">
        </a>
        <p>{{ section.settings.blurb }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Shop</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/collections/all">All Products</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/playstation-5">PlayStation 5</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/nintendo-switch">Nintendo Switch 2</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/zerostick-dualsense-edge-tmr-replacement">DualSense Edge Modules</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/tmr-mail-in-service-ps5-xbox-switch-2">Mail-In TMR Service</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        The content hub. Each link appears only once its page exists in admin,
        so this column grows as the guides are published.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if guide_count > 0 -%}
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Resources</h4>
        {%- comment -%}
          Handles and labels are parallel lists. Each link renders only if the
          page exists — testing `pg.url` rather than the page object, which is
          the idiom already used in zerostick-exo.liquid and is unambiguous when
          the handle is missing (nil.url is nil, which is falsy).
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign guide_handles = 'dualsense-edge-stick-drift-guide,tmr-vs-hall-effect,how-tmr-modules-work,testing-and-calibration,installation-guide,compatibility,faq,8k-controllers,ps5-builder' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- assign guide_labels = 'DualSense Edge Drift Guide,TMR vs Hall Effect,How TMR Modules Work,Testing &amp; Calibration,Installation Guide,Compatibility,FAQ,8K Controllers,PS5 Builder' | split: ',' -%}
        <ul>
          {%- for h in guide_handles -%}
            {%- assign pg = pages[h] -%}
            {%- if pg.url -%}
              <li><a href="{{ pg.url }}">{{ guide_labels[forloop.index0] }}</a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Support</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/pages/contact">Contact Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/mail-in-tmr-service">Mail-In Service</a></li>
          <li><a href="/policies/shipping-policy">Shipping</a></li>
          <li><a href="/policies/refund-policy">Returns</a></li>
          <li><a href="/policies/terms-of-service">Warranty</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Company</h4>
        <ul>
          {%- assign about_pg = pages['about'] -%}
          {%- if about_pg.url -%}
            <li><a href="{{ about_pg.url }}">About ZeroStick</a></li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Customer accounts are disabled on this store — /account, /account/login
            and /account/register all return 406. Linking them sends people to a
            dead end, so the link only appears if accounts are ever turned on.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
            <li><a href="/account/login">My Account</a></li>
          {%- endif -%}
          <li><a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Cart</a></li>
          {%- if blogs['news'].articles_count > 0 -%}
            <li><a href="/blogs/news">News</a></li>
          {%- endif -%}
        </ul>

        {%- comment -%}
          Social URLs are settings now. Unset renders nothing — the old markup
          hardcoded href="#" and shipped three dead links on every page.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.social_instagram != blank
            or section.settings.social_tiktok != blank
            or section.settings.social_youtube != blank -%}
          <h4 style="margin-top:24px">Follow Us</h4>
          <div class="social-links" style="flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            {%- if section.settings.social_instagram != blank -%}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_instagram }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.social_tiktok != blank -%}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_tiktok }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">TikTok</a>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.social_youtube != blank -%}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_youtube }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">YouTube</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom zs-legal">
      <span>&copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} ZeroStick, a brand of Reliable Trend Enterprises LLC. All rights reserved.</span>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/policies/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
        {%- comment -%}
          CCPA/CPRA opt-out. This page was live but unreachable — nothing in the
          theme linked to it, so the opt-out route did not actually exist for a
          visitor. Reliable Trend Enterprises is a California LLC.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign ccpa_pg = pages['data-sharing-opt-out'] -%}
        {%- if ccpa_pg.url -%}
          <a href="{{ ccpa_pg.url }}">Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        <a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75">
      <span>7426 Cherry Ave, Ste 210 #1062, Fontana, CA 92336</span>
      <span>
        <a href="tel:+13236804706" style="color:inherit">(323) 680-4706</a> &middot;
        <a href="mailto:reliabletrendenterprises@gmail.com" style="color:inherit">reliabletrendenterprises@gmail.com</a>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZeroStick Footer",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "blurb",
      "label": "Brand blurb",
      "default": "High-performance modified controllers built for speed, precision, and durability. Genuine first-party controllers, upgraded with TMR technology and backed by a 5-year stick warranty."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Social links",
      "info": "Leave a field empty to hide that link entirely."
    },
    { "type": "url", "id": "social_instagram", "label": "Instagram" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "social_tiktok", "label": "TikTok" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "social_youtube", "label": "YouTube" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
